CONCLUSION: c(f) is supported ONLY on the small mu_2-set (base misses 1-2 sectors).
This is why |c(f)| is small and f*c(f) is a bounded Dedekind sum (THM-563 mechanism,
restricted to the |R(x)|<=2 support). mu_2 SHRINKS the effective constant.
